---
import RecommendationExplorer from './RecommendationExplorer.astro';import {topics} from '../data/site';import {catalog,totalPlans} from '../data/selection';
---
<section class="selection-banner"><div><span class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR OWN ROUTE</span><h2>预算与用量，<br/>一起决定候选。</h2><p>从参考套餐找到合适的容量，再通过自己的网络验证体验。</p></div><div class="selection-stats"><span><b>29</b> 指定品牌</span><span><b>{catalog.filter(b=>b.plans.length).length}</b> 有参考套餐</span><span><b>{totalPlans}</b> 套餐记录</span></div></section><nav class="scenario-nav" aria-label="按需求浏览">{topics.map(t=><a href={`/recommend/${t.slug}/`}><span>{t.icon}</span><b>{t.name}</b><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</nav><div class="section-head selection-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">BUILD YOUR SHORTLIST</span><h2>找到符合条件的参考套餐</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/ranking/budget/">按月付价格看排行 ↗</a></div><RecommendationExplorer/><section class="selection-steps"><a href="/blog/selection-checklist/"><span>01</span><h3>核对购买条件</h3><p>价格、倍率、重置周期与退款规则。</p></a><a href="/compare/"><span>02</span><h3>比较 2–4 个候选</h3><p>看清月付金额、容量和现有优惠。</p></a><a href="/guides/troubleshooting/"><span>03</span><h3>用自己的网络验证</h3><p>短期试用后，再考虑延长周期。</p></a></section>
